   characterization results (its table note 2), rev Y's 400 MHz all-peripherals figures at TJ 25 and 105 C tested in production: PRINTED). The order code STM32H743VIT6 does
   not fix the silicon revision, so both revisions' tables apply: rev Y, Table 30 (p.111); rev V, Table 129 (p.218)
