10. THE STATE OF L9T5-F06 (T10)
   L9T5-F06 STAYS OPEN: the conditions are verified from the sources (the state is unbounded), a correction is selected with its acceptance
   criterion, and its circuit half is drafted and read by its author only. No independent check has read it; Layer 5 has not accepted the
   row; nothing is applied. This is the first attempt at this correction
   FINDINGS FOR OTHER AUTHORS
   L9T5-F09 (Layer 5, HW-FW-CONTRACT.md 3.3): the supervisors' state is bounded by no row; the row text above (T10-A1); the FMEA row for a
